%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account API (Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant WebApp as Banking Web Application
    participant API as Youth Account API
    participant Account as Account Service
    participant Payment as Payment Service
    participant Transaction as Transaction Service
    participant DB as Youth Account DB

    %% Dashboard Retrieval
    Parent->>WebApp: Login & navigate to Dashboard
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (OAuth2)
    API->>Account: Fetch account details
    API->>Transaction: Fetch recent transactions
    API->>DB: Fetch spending limit
    API-->>WebApp: Dashboard data (balance, limit, transactions)
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display dashboard

    %% Fund Transfer
    Parent->>WebApp: Initiate fund transfer
    WebApp->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer (OAuth2)
    API->>Payment: Initiate transfer
    Payment-->>API: Transfer result
    API->>Account: Update balances
    API->>Transaction: Log transaction
    API->>DB: Update settings if needed
    API-->>WebApp: Transfer confirmation
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show transfer status

    %% Set Spending Limit
    Parent->>WebApp: Set new spending limit
    WebApp->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit (OAuth2)
    API->>DB: Update weekly limit
    API-->>WebApp: Limit updated
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show confirmation

    %% Transaction History
    Parent->>WebApp: View transaction history
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions (OAuth2)
    API->>Transaction: Fetch transactions
    API-->>WebApp: Transaction data
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display transactions
